Bind Npc 31558 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 31557 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 645 "Procurement of Specialty Goods II"
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Sailor] Hayes."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Sailor] Hein."
    Collect 3 of 389760000

Requires player level >= 62 and quest 644 is completed

Rewards
    Give 7500000 experience
    Give 10000 coins
    Give 1 of 900198000

direction_14 = location "Tyon" about "Tyon\nBoar monster evolved by Pathos' evil power" found "El Morad " at 1684 779 in zone 2
direction_344 = location "Tyon" about "Tyon\nBoar monster evolved by Pathos' evil power" found "Karus" at 360 1300 in zone 1

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "[Sailor] Hayes is looking for me again. I think he's going to ask me to bring him something again."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "The sailors by Hein that I'm looking for us. Saved somehow something else ... I think I will come"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Good to see you again. I asked for you because I need to ask you for a favor."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It is called [Rare Fruit]. I'm certain that it comes from this area here in Adonis but I just can't seem to find it. I heard [Tions] know where it is.\n\n[From the tayion] in accordance with the request of Karus Regional Executive pugeo port sailors and yes, you will need to gather a rare fruit."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Embraced see you again. I can ask, is so welcome."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It is called [Rare Fruit]. I'm certain that it comes from this area here in Adonis but I just can't seem to find it. I heard [Tions] know where to get it. Well...good luck, then.\n\nUpon request of Aladdin and Local Rod Elmo Sharks captain of the port, you will need to gather a rare fruit from the tayion."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "Stii haven't found it? It's taking longer than I thought."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_344
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Stii haven't found it? It's taking longer than I thought."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_14

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Hmm ... So you've managed to get it. Thank you.\n\nThen again, it also ask for delivery. A fruit box specially made for this time secret agent Clarence can be delivered. Please the receipt and packed pilhi, last. Goodbye."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Hmm ... So you've managed to get it. Thank you.\n\nI have another delivery request to make of you again. Please deliver this [Specialty Fruits Box] to Clarence, the [Secret Agent]. And please don't forget to bring me the receipt! Good luck."
